  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Beautiful_Potions/BH_Beautiful_Potions_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">這個資源包改變了藥水的外觀，包括原版《Minecraft》以及許多熱門模組中的藥水。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">《Minecraft》社群長期以來一直希望藥水能擁有更獨特且易於辨識的外觀。本資源包正是為了實現這一目標，為每種藥水設計了專屬的瓶身樣式和視覺風格。紋理經過重新設計，變得更色彩豐富、清晰且視覺吸引力更強，讓每種藥水都脫穎而出，更容易識別。<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">我們還支援超過31個模組，包括：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Alex's Mobs、Apothic Attributes、Apotheosis、Ars Elemental、Ars Noveau、Autumnity、Ben' Sharks、Buzzier Bees、Corail Tombstone、Crabber's Delight、Deep Aether、Deeper and Darker、Ecologics、Eternal Starlight、Friends & Foes、Goblin Traders、Hybrid Aquatic、Illager Invasion、Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks、Kobolds、Mowzie's Mobs、Mutant Monster、Occultism、PotionsMaster、Stalwart Dungeons、Supplementaries、The Bumblezone、The Undergarden、Untitled Duck、Upgrade Aquatic 和 Yung's Cave Biomes。</span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-resewn\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT Resewn</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-cit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge CIT</a>（也相容 OptiFine）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">這些紋理的設計者是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/arkadyaaa/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arkadya</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器與朋友同樂嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Beautiful_Potions/BH_Beautiful_Potions_promo2.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\"></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">如果你正在尋找伺服器與朋友遊玩任何模組或模組包，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a></span> 是你的最佳選擇！他們提供性價比最高的《Minecraft》伺服器，點擊 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong></span> 並使用優惠碼「Lupin」，即可享有 25% 折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Beautiful_Potions/BH_Beautiful_Potions_description.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">「美麗藥水」的目標很簡單：將《Minecraft》的藥水轉變為視覺盛宴，以多樣化、主題化的設計取代標準藥水瓶，提升其魅力。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">每種藥水將根據其特定效果，搭配專屬的瓶身風格與配色方案，並加入獨特細節，使其更加突出。我們相信你會愛上這些令人驚豔的新設計！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Beautiful_Potions/BH_Beautiful_Potions_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>能在伺服器上使用嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！運作完全正常！請記住，與朋友遊玩模組的最佳方式是使用 BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結可獲得 25% 折扣</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此資源包可用於模組包嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！但僅限於在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上發布的模組包。將其上傳至其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，且絕不允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">然而，如果你考慮將其加入你的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 模組包，我們將非常感激。如需任何小調整或有疑問，請聯絡我們！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Beautiful_Potions/BH_Beautiful_Potions_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1196/795/beautiful-potions-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1196/799/beautiful-potions-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1196/800/beautiful-potions-10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1027\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></a></p>",
